  <p id="c-liangshu-028-four-appraisals:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：<persName id="c-liangshu-028-four-appraisals:p001:m0004" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">裴邃</persName>之詞采早著，兼思略沉深，夏侯稟之好學辯給，<persName id="c-liangshu-028-four-appraisals:p001:m0027" ref="zz1_0tr_xni_B">夔</persName>之奢豪愛士，<persName id="c-liangshu-028-four-appraisals:p001:m0034" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAA">韋放</persName>之弘厚篤行，並遇主逢時，展其才用矣。及牧州典郡，破敵安邊，咸著功績，允文武之任，蓋梁室之名臣歟。</p>
</text>
